Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:56:01 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] V2h: certify the marginal Gram entry J_T[P2,P2] (twentieth
 pair)

Two distinguished coordinates: piece_mono integrates every monomial weight
on a piece as (prod t_i!) * pieceM at the rough and smooth degrees;
sum_place2 places an ordered pair of coordinates by class (n_c n_d - [c=d] n_c
off the diagonal, n_c on it); q2J_expand collects P2-hat^2 into 15 moments.
p2p2Entry_eq gives (N+1) * int (U P2-hat + U^3/3)^2 in closed form for every N;
at Table 3 J_T[P2,P2] = J_T(P2) ~ 2.27107e-58 is an explicit rational
(moment-table certificate, 3 059 piece lemmas in 14 per-row files).

